                    {
                        "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                        "entry_id": "0d1beae2-2b35-365b-acbf-31406758e6b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A phobia of renal disease."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0983dddf-fb5f-4a77-bca4-6574be8b3e33",
                                "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                                "text": "In spermatorrhea when albumin is present this is especially true. In nephritic subjects albuminurophobia is often seen and it works adversely on the morale of the patient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2eec788-b808-41bc-8e06-d8d195e5b84e",
                                "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                                "text": "for some reason, there are apparently quite a number of people who suffer from Albuminurophobia—the fear of kidney disease"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70ef5c3c-22e7-4fbc-9522-5819d2236c9a",
                                "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                                "text": "This identification may professionally introduce this mental representation into the clinical practice, because phobia of renal failure may represent a marked psychiatric impact among peoples who have a relative, friend, or a neighbor with CKD or ESRD and on hemodialysis. Clinically, it presents with anxiety disorders such as irrational fear of getting renal failure where it is also known as albuminurophobia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f0515ed-d913-4412-a366-98f2a3ab76a1",
                                "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                                "text": "A person doesn’t necessarily need to be in a situation exposed to kidney disease to experience Albuminurophobia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99d2d648-7c7a-4bb5-b115-cb3cb178ab65",
                                "sense_id": "d67e1ae8-2ea8-3428-b43d-c0de5ddf9fa6",
                                "text": "Although panic attacks may not always be the case for everyone experiencing symptoms of albuminurophobia, it is still possible to occur, especially if their symptoms are very severe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
